e in fear of titans again and  aldeans themselves would no longer have  to suffer  of course this was just a hypothetical  situation that zeke happened to think of  but you can tell he didn't seriously  intend to do anything until he heard  about tom's past  like zeke salva also believed it would  have been better to have never been born  as his malian wife killed herself and  his son once she found out he was an  aldian miner spoilers ahead but as tom  reminisces about his past  you can see there was a sheep plushie  next to him previously when we saw  zeke's past in season 3  he was playing with a monkey plushie and  that's what he became is the beast titan  so the implication of putting this sheet  next to tom is referring to what his  titan is  i know a lot of people to this day think  he had a whale beast titan but no if he  had a whale then trust me this would  have been a world plushie instead  when zeke eventually inherited the titan  from tom the ceremony was held in this  special room that was later used for  porco and the other warrior candidates  something worth pointing out is that  after zeke ate the beast titan he  emerged from the smoke holding sarva's  glasses in his hand  and refers to tom as his father this is  a direct parallel to an eren 8 grisha  as he initially woke up holding his  father's glasses as well  in zeke's case he went on to wear those  glasses pretty much for the rest of his  life up until now  and that was his way of honoring his  adopted father before tom died  he told zeke that he would always be  watching over him which is why later in  the episode  present day zeke said he hoped cassava  was watching moving on during season 2  you'll remember how the beast titan  arrived on paradise island to see what  was going on  whilst in the finale reiner and bertolt  witnessed aaron using the founding titan  here we get a new flashback to after  those events in which reiner informs  zeke of the intel they've gathered  with the knowledge 